{"type":"standard","title":"Wichí Lhamtés Nocten","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Wichí Lhamtés Nocten</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q5908756","titles":{"canonical":"Wichí_Lhamtés_Nocten","normalized":"Wichí Lhamtés Nocten","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Wichí Lhamtés Nocten</span></span>"},"pageid":8230606,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1354706244","tid":"5010f670-523c-11f1-9226-387c8e536661","timestamp":"2026-05-17T22:04:02Z","description":"Wichí language spoken in Bolivia","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wich%C3%AD_Lhamt%C3%A9s_Nocten","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wich%C3%AD_Lhamt%C3%A9s_Nocten?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wich%C3%AD_Lhamt%C3%A9s_Nocten?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Wich%C3%AD_Lhamt%C3%A9s_Nocten"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wich%C3%AD_Lhamt%C3%A9s_Nocten","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Wich%C3%AD_Lhamt%C3%A9s_Nocten","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wich%C3%AD_Lhamt%C3%A9s_Nocten?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Wich%C3%AD_Lhamt%C3%A9s_Nocten"}},"extract":"Wichí Lhamtés Nocten, or Weenhayek, is a Wichí language spoken primarily in Bolivia, as well as in Argentina. The language is also called \"Mataco\", \"Mataco Nocten\", Nocten, Noctenes, and Oktenai, though the name \"Mataco\" has negative connotations.","extract_html":"<p><b>Wichí Lhamtés Nocten</b>, or <b>Weenhayek</b>, is a Wichí language spoken primarily in Bolivia, as well as in Argentina. The language is also called \"Mataco\", \"Mataco Nocten\", Nocten, Noctenes, and Oktenai, though the name \"Mataco\" has negative connotations.</p>"}